flowchart LR
	IN["The listener registered with prepend: true -<br/>the gate sees the pristine result."] --> NEXT["next() always awaited FIRST"]
	NEXT -.- NOTE["Omitting it short-circuits the downstream<br/>post-execute listeners - the spill-policy precedent."]
	NEXT --> DEC["The downstream decision"]
	DEC -. "pass-through: return the decision unchanged" .-> SAME["Byte-identical semantics"]
	DEC --> REPL["Only an accepted, non-value-carrying<br/>decision replaced"]
	REPL -. "an internal error: log a warning and keep the<br/>inline content - never throw into the waterfall" .-> OPEN["Fail-open"]
